{"unit_id":"wobenshiwomu__dsh-calm#card-zh","repo":"wobenshiwomu/dsh-calm","commit":"c698f6321871a34204c1e8695c94ad905bc3bbc9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-calm（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为激烈对话提供安抚和会话恢复。它在 agent/pre-step 阶段分类用户消息，进入安抚模式时注入提示并临时拦截写入类工具；用户恢复正常任务后，将争吵区间折叠封存并以摘要继续。主要功能包括滚动窗口终止、封存记录脱敏调阅及主动结束会话。适合需要让 DSH 在冲突对话后回到任务上下文的场景。无需 API Key 或外部服务；可配置窗口、工具拦截规则和原文读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:349-398","src/index.mjs:435-493","src/index.mjs:499-576"]}
{"unit_id":"wobenshiwomu__dsh-calm#card-en","repo":"wobenshiwomu/dsh-calm","commit":"c698f6321871a34204c1e8695c94ad905bc3bbc9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-calm is a DSH Web plugin for calming heated exchanges and resuming tasks. It adds a calming prompt, guards side-effect tools, then seals the exchange and adds a summary. It supports audited, redacted record access and rolling-window termination. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:349-398","src/index.mjs:435-493","src/index.mjs:499-576"]}
