{"unit_id":"wobenshiwomu__dsh-calm#feature-1","repo":"wobenshiwomu/dsh-calm","commit":"c698f6321871a34204c1e8695c94ad905bc3bbc9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-calm 的功能「安抚与工具闸门」：进入安抚状态时向本轮消息加入引导注记，并按配置临时拦截写入或命令类工具；只读工具可继续使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:349-398"]}
{"unit_id":"wobenshiwomu__dsh-calm#feature-2","repo":"wobenshiwomu/dsh-calm","commit":"c698f6321871a34204c1e8695c94ad905bc3bbc9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-calm 的功能「折叠争吵并恢复任务」：用户给出实质指令后，插件把激烈交流从模型可见上下文折叠，以恢复摘要替代，并保留会话日志记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.mjs:176-210"]}
